# The iOS app links to the extensionless /privacy, /terms and /support from Settings and the
# paywall (ios/App/UI/Settings/SettingsView.swift, PaywallView.swift). Cloudflare Pages serves
# privacy.html at /privacy by itself and redirects /privacy.html to /privacy, so a rewrite of
# /privacy to /privacy.html here loops forever (308 to itself, measured with `wrangler pages dev`).
# Netlify gets its rewrites from netlify.toml instead. Do not add them back here.

# The free web app is served by server.js on Fly.io at app.cartworth.app (ops/deploy-web.md). Every
# "Open the free web app" link on this site points at /app/, which sends visitors there.
# (Never rewrite to /index.html: Cloudflare strips /index and the rule loops.)
/app/*   https://app.cartworth.app/:splat   302
/app     https://app.cartworth.app/         302
